<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Goofa</book>
  <para style="h">Efesoona</para>
  <para style="toc3">Efe</para>
  <para style="toc2">Efesoona</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosi Efesoona Asaas Xaafida Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosi Efesoona Asaas</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafida Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofaa</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosi Efesoonan de7iya asaas xaafida kiitan ubbaafe aathidi xeellidabay, “Wodey gakkiya wode Xoossay polanaw qoppida qofay, saloninne sa7an de7iya medhetetha ubbay Kiristtoosappe garssan gidana melassa” yaagiya qofaa (1:10). Hessa bolla gujjidi Yesuus Kiristtoosara de7iya issifetethan, asa zerethi ubbay issino gidana mela ha gita qofaa ooson peeshshana mela Xoossaa asaa hassayisees.</para>
  <para style="ip">Efesoona kiitaa koyro kifiliyan xaafey kaara qofa gidida issifetethabaa xaafanaw doomidayssa dalggisidi, Xoossay Aaway ba asaa waati dooridaakko, enttika iya na7aa, Yesuus Kiristtoosan bantta nagaraappe maarota demmidi waanidi la77a keyidaakkonne, Xoossaa gita ufayssa qaalay Geeshsha Ayyaana baggara tuma gideyssi erettidaakko odees. Nam77antho kifiliyan qassi xaafey ha kiitaa nabbabiya asay bantta issifetethaa de7uwan Kiristtoosan enttaw de7iya issifetethay tuma gidana mela entti waanidi daanaw bessiyako qofisees.</para>
  <para style="ip">Asay Kiristtoosan de7iya issifetethaa waanidi daanaw bessiyako dumma dumma leemison qonccis. Woosa keethi asatethaa leemiso gidiya wode Kiristtoosi he asatethaas huu7e. Woosa keethi gimbbe keethan leemisettiya wode Kiristtoosi he keethaa godaa xaphuwa minthiya waanna shuchchaa. Woosa keethi machchin leemisettiya wode Kiristtoosi azinan leemisettis. Xaafey Kiristtoosa baggara qonccida Xoossaa aadho keehatethaa daro nashshidi odishe, giddoy ciimmottiya haasaya haasayees. I ubbabaa, Kiristtoosa siiquwa, iya yarshshetethaa, I immida nagara atotethaa, iya aadho keehatethaanne iya geeshshatethaa baggara xeellees.</para>
  <para style="iot">Efesoona kiitaa ayfe qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Sarotho 1:1-2</para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosanne woosa keethi 1:3-3:21</para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosan de7iya ooratha de7uwa 4:1-6:20</para>
  <para style="io1">Kuushsha qofaa 6:21-24</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Xoossaa shenen Kiristtoos Yesuusa hawaare gidida Phawuloosappe, Efesoonan de7iya geeshshatasinne Kiristtoos Yesuusa ammaneyssatas xaafettida kiitaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:19-21">Ha@O 18:19-21</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:1">19:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Xoossaa nu Aawappenne Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosappe aadho keehatethaynne sarotethay hinttew gido.</para>
  <para style="s">Kiristtoosan de7iya ayyaana anjjuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Salon de7iya ayyaana anjjo ubban Kiristtoosa baggara nuna anjjida, nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosa Aaway, Xoossay galatetto. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nuuni iya sinthan geeshshatanne borey baynnayssata gidana mela Xoossay alamey medhettanaappe kase Kiristtoosa baggara ba siiquwan nuna dooris. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Xoossay ba sheniyan ba dosidayssada Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggara nuna ba nayta oothanaw kasetidi qoppi wothis. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Xoossay ba siiqiya Na7aa baggara nuus coo immida aadho keehatethay bonchchettana mela hessa oothis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Xoossaa aadho keehatethaa duretethaada Kiristtoosa suuthan wozettidi nagara atotethaa demmida. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ba aadho keehatethaa cinccatethaninne eratethan kunthidi nuus immis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:14">Qola 1:14</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v"/>Xoossay ba dosidayssada Kiristtoosa baggara iya sheniya xuuraa nu erana mela oothis. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Wodey gakkiya wode Xoossay polanaw qoppida qofay, saloninne sa7an de7iya medhetetha ubbay Kiristtoosappe garssan gidana melassa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ubbabaa ba sheniyada oothiya Xoossay, kasetidi ba qoppi wothidayssada Kiristtoosa baggara nuuni iyabaa gidana mela nuna dooris. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessa I oothiday, Kiristtoosan ufayssi wothidi naagon koyro gidida nuuni Xoossaa bonchchuwa galatan qonccisana melassa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hintteka hintte atotethaa Wonggelaa, hessika tuma qaala si7ida wode Kiristtoosa ammanideta. Xoossay hinttew immana gida Geeshsha Ayyaanan hintte attamettideta. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Xoossaa bonchchoy galatettana mela Xoossay ba asaa wozana gakkanaw Geeshsha Ayyaana nuus oythu oothidi immis.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosa woosaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Godaa Yesuusa hintte ammaneyssanne geeshshata ubbaa hintte siiqeyssa ta si7ida wode <verse number="16" style="v"/>ta woosan hinttena qoppashe hintte gisho Xoossaa galateyssa aggabikke. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosa Xoossay, bonchcho Aaway, Xoossaa hintte aathi eranaada cinccatethaanne qonccethaa ayyaana hinttew immanaada taani Xoossaa woossays. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Xoossay hinttena xeegida ufayssaynne geeshshati laattiya bonchcho laatay ay mela darookko hintte erana mela Xoossay hintte wozana ayfiyaa dooyana mela taani Xoossaa woossays.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Qassi iya ammaniyaa nunan oothiya iya wolqqay ay mela aadhdhida giteekko hintte erana mela woossays. He wolqqay xoonettonanne daaburonna wolqqaa. Ha nunan de7idi oothiya wolqqaynne, <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kiristtoosa hayqoppe denthidi, salon Xoossaafe ushachcha baggara utisida gita wolqqay issino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz 110:1</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v"/>Iya sunthay, ayseyssatappenne maata aawatappe, haareyssatappenne godatappe, bolla gididi ha alamiya xalaalan gidonnashin, sinthafe yaana alamiyankka hara sunthata ubbaafe dhoqqa. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Xoossay ubbaa Kiristtoosa tohuwappe garssan haarisis; qassi woosa keethan ubbaban Goda gidana mela iya shuumis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:6">Maz 8:6</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:22-23">Qola 1:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:18">1:18</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v"/>Woosa keethay Kiristtoosa kumethi oothiya iya asatethaa. Medhetethay de7iya bessa ubban Kiristtoosi ba huu7en ubbabaa kuntheyssa.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kiristtoosan hayqoppe de7o pinethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hayssafe kase hinttee, hintte nagaraanne hintte qohuwa gaason hayqqidayssata.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1-5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:13">Qola 2:13</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v"/>He wode hintte ha alamiya iita ogiya kaallideta. Carkkuwa bolla de7iya ayyaana wolqqata halaqaasinne ha77ika Xoossaas kiitettonna asaa haariya ayyaanas kiitettideta. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nu ubbayka kase he asata giddon nu asho amuwaanne nu wozanaa sheniya kaallidi de7ida. Nukka harata mela nu medhetethan Xoossaa hanquwa ekkanaw de7eyssata.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Shin Xoossaa gita maarotethaafenne nuus de7iya gita siiquwappe denddidayssan, <verse number="5" style="v"/>hari attoshin nuuni nu qohuwan hayqqidi de7ishin Kiristtoosa baggara nuus de7o immis. Hintteka attiday Xoossaa aadho keehatethaana. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Xoossay nuna Kiristtoosara issife hayqoppe denthidi salo sohuwan iyara issife wothis. <verse number="7" style="v"/>I hessa oothiday, Kiristtoos Yesuusa baggara nuus qonccisida ba keehatethaanne zawi baynna ba aadho keehatetha duretethaa yaana laythan nuna bessanaassa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hintte aadho keehatethan ammanon attideta. Hessika, Xoossaa imotappe attin hintte ooson benttidabaa gidenna. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Oonikka ceeqettonna mela atotethay benttiday ooson gidenna. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nuuni Xoossaa medhetethi; I nuus kasetidi giigisi wothida lo77o oosota oothana mela Kiristtoos Yesuusa baggara oorathi medhettida.</para>
  <para style="s">Kiristtoosara de7iya issifetethaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, hinttenoo yeletan Ayhude gidonnayssato, Ayhudeti banttaw asa kushen qaxxarettidi, hinttena qassi qaxxarettiboonayssata gidi xeegeyssa akeekite. <verse number="12" style="v"/>He wode hintte Kiristtoosappe shaaketti de7idayssa, Isra7eele asaas allaga gididi de7idayssa, Xoossaa ufayssa qaalappe haakkidi de7idayssanne ha alamiyan ufayssinne Xoossi baynna de7idayssa akeekite. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Shin hintte kase haakkidi de7idayssati, ha77i Kiristtoos Yesuusan de7idi Kiristtoosa suuthan mata shiiqideta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kiristtoosi nu sarotethaa; I Ayhudenne Ayhude gidonna asaa timidi, nam77aa shaakki wothida morkketetha godaa laallis. <verse number="15" style="v"/>I banan ha nam77u zaretappe issi ooratha ase medhdhidi, higgiya iya kiitaranne wogatara issife ba asatethan dhayssidi sarotethi immis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:14">Qola 2:14</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kiristtoosi masqaliya bolla hayqqidi morkketethaa dhayssis; qassi nam77u zareta issi asatethi oothidi Xoossaara sigethis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:20">Qola 1:20</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kiristtoosi yidi, Xoossaafe haakkidi de7iya hinttew, qassi mati de7iya enttaw sarotetha Wonggelaa odis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:19">Isa 57:19</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nu ubbay iya baggara issi Ayyaanan Aawa sinthe shiiqanaw dandda7os.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hizappe hintte allaga woykko imathe gidekketa, shin hintte ha77i geeshshata biittaa asinne Xoossaa soo asi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hintte hawaaretinne nabeti baasida baasuwa bolla keexettideta. Godaa xaphuwa minthiya shuchchay Kiristtoos Yesuusa. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Iyan keetha ubbay issife oykettidi Godan geeshsha Xoossa keethi gidanaw diccees. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hintte qassi Xoossay ba Ayyaanan de7iya keethi gidanaw Kiristtoosan issife keexetteta.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ayhude gidonna asaas hawaare gidida Phawuloosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, taani, Phawuloosi, Ayhude gidonna hintte gisho Kiristtoos Yesuusan qasho asi gidas. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ta hinttena maaddana mela Xoossay ba aadho keehatethan taw immida ha oosuwabaa hintte loythi si7ideta. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ta hinttew kase qanthan xaafidayssada Xoossay ba xuuraa qonccethan taw qonccisis. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ta xaafidayssa hintte nabbabiya wode Kiristtoosa xuuraa ta ay mela eridaakko hintte akeekanaw dandda7eeta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4-6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:26-27">Qola 1:26-27</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ha xuuray geeshsha hawaaretasinne nabetas ha77i Ayyaana baggara qonccidayssada beni wode asaas hessada qonccisibeenna. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Xuuray hayssa: Ayhude gidonna asay Wonggelaa baggara Isra7eeletara issife Xoossaa anjjuwaa laattoosona. Isra7eeletara issi keetha asi gidoosona; Kiristtoos Yesuusa baggaara Xoossaa ufayssa qaala ekkoosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Xoossay ba oothiya wolqqaa baggara taw immida aadho keehatethan ha Wonggelas oosanchcho gidas. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Taani geeshshata ubbaafe laafa gidikkoka Ayhude gidonna asaas zawi baynna Kiristtoosa duretethaa Wonggelaa odana mela ha aadho keehatethay taw imettis. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Qassi kase wodiyan ubbaa medhdhida Xoossan qosettidi de7iya xuuras, Xoossaa qofay aybeekko qonccisanaw aadho keehatethay taw imettis. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Xoossay hessa oothiday ha77i wodiyan woosa keetha baggara salo sohuwan de7iya halaqatasinne haareyssatas ba dumma dumma qonccethaa erisanaassa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Xoossay ba merinaa qofaa nu Godaa Kiristtoos Yesuusa baggara polanaw hessa oothis. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nu ammanon yashshi baynna Xoossako shiiqana mela Kiristtoosi nuus minotethinne la77atethi immis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Taani hintte gisho waaye ekkiya gisho, hintte ta waayan yeellatonnaada hinttena woossays; taani hintte bonchchuwas waayettays.</para>
  <para style="s">Efesoona asaas woosettida woosaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Taani aawa sinthan gulbbatada woossey hessa gishossa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Saloninne sa7an de7iya issi issi soo asay iyan sunthettees. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Xoossay ba bonchcho duretethaafe hintte garssa asatethaa minthiya wolqqaa ba Ayyaana baggara immana mela hinttew woossays. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Qassi ammanon Kiristtoosi hintte wozanan daana melanne hintte siiqon xapho yeddidi minnidi daana mela woossays. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hessadakka, Kiristtoosa siiqoy ay mela dalggeko, adusseeko, dhoqqekonne ciimmooko geeshshata ubbaara eriya wolqqaa hintte akeekana mela woossays. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Eratethaafe aadhdhiya Kiristtoosa siiquwa hintte erana mela qassi de7o immiya Xoossaa wolqqan hintte kumana mela ta woossays.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hiza, nu giddon oothiya ba wolqqaa baggara nuuni woosseyssafe woykko qoppeyssafe aathidi oothanaw dandda7iya Xoossaas, <verse number="21" style="v"/>woosa keethaninne Kiristtoos Yesuusan wode ubban merinaappe merinaa gakkanaw bonchchoy gido. Amin7i.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kiristtoosara de7iya issifetethaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hiza, Godaa gisho qashettida taani, hintte xeegettida xeessas bessiya de7o daana mela hinttena woossays. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hintte ubba wode aadatanne hayo gidite; issoy issuwa dandda7itenne siiqon de7ite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:12-13">Qola 3:12-13</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v"/>Sarotethan qashettidi Ayyaanay immiya issifetethaa naaganaw minnite. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Xoossay hinttena xeegida wode issi ufayssas xeegidayssada issi asatethinne issi Ayyaani de7ees. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Issi Goday, issi ammanoynne issi xinqqatey de7ees. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ubbaafe bolla gidida, ubbaa baggara oothiyanne ubbaa giddon de7iya issi Xoossay, ubbaa Aaway de7ees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Shin Kiristtoosi immanaw koyidayssada nu issoy issoy dumma dumma imota ekkida. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Xoossaa qaalay,</para>
  <para style="q">“I pude keyida wode di7ettida darota baara ekkidi bis;</para>
  <para style="q2">asaaskka imotaa immis” yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:18">Maz 68:18</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yaatin, “Pude keyis” guussay woy guussee? I koyro duge, sa7aa ziqqa bessaa wodhdhis guussu gidonna ixxiko ay gussee? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ha duge wodhdhidayssi, ubba bessan benttanaw ubbaafe dhoqqa saluwa keyidayssi iya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>I issota issota hawaare, issota issota nabe, issota issota Wonggelaa sabaake, issota issota woosa keethi heemmeyssa, issota issota asttamaare oothidi immis. <verse number="12" style="v"/>I hessa oothiday Kiristtoosa asatethi gidida woosa keethi dichchanawunne ammaniyaa asaa Xoossaa oosos giigisanaassa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hessadakka, nu ubbay Xoossaa Na7aa eridi ammanon benttiya issifetethaakko gakkidi, Kiristtoosa ayyaana de7uwa kumethaa gakkidi diccana melassa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hizappe guye, asaa gene cimon giigida balethiya worddo timirtte carkkoninne hobben gedenne haa kuullo kaa7iya nayta mela gidanaw bessenna. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Shin nuuni tumaa siiqon odishe asatetethaas huu7e gidiya Kiristtoosara de7iya issifetethaa gujji gujji dichchoos. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kumetha asatethay Kiristtoosa bolla zemppees qassi dumma dumma asatetha billiteti issoy issuwara oykettidi uttis. Issi issi asatetha kifiley ba oosuwa oothiya wode kumetha asatethay siiqon diccees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:19">Qola 2:19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Kiristtoosan ooratha de7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, taani hayssa hinttew Godaa sunthan odaysinne markkattays. Go77i baynna qofaa qoppiya Ayhude gidonna asatada de7oppite. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Entta qofay dhumis; bantta wozanaa muumisidosona. Entti eratetha dhayoninne ixxas guussan Xoossay immiya de7uwappe haakkidosona. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Entti yeella giyabaa erokkonna; entti laymatethas banttana aathi immidosona; qassi tunabaa ubbaa guye goonna oothoosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Shin hintte Kiristtoosa eriday hessa mela ogen gidenna. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Iyabaa tuma si7ideta. Qassi Yesuusan de7iya tumaa mela iyappe tamaarideta. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hintte kase de7iya de7o ogiya aggite. Qassi ba cimmiya amon dhaya hintte ceega asatethaa diggite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:9">Qola 3:9</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v"/>Hintte wozanaa qofan ooraxite. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Tuma xillotethaninne geeshshatethan Xoossaa leemison medhettida ooratha asatethaa ma77ite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Medhe 1:26</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:10">Qola 3:10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hiza, worddo odettofite. Nuuni ubbay Kiristtoosa asatethaa billiteta gidiya gisho asa ubbaara tuma odettite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 8:16">Zakka 8:16</ref></char></note> <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hanqettite, shin hintte hanquwan nagara oothofite. Hintte hanqeti de7ishin awi wullofo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 4:4">Maz 4:4</ref></char></note> <verse number="27" style="v"/>Xalahes besse immofite. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kaysiya uray hizappe guye kaysotoppo. Shin manqota maaddiyabay iyaw daana mela ba kushen lo77obaa ootho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Hintte doonappe iita qaali keyoppo. Shin si7eyssata go77ana melanne harata minthethiya koshshiya lo77o qaali hintte doonappe keyo. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Xoossay hinttena woziya gallasaas hinttena attamidi wothida Xoossaa Ayyaana azzanthofite. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Cametethi, yilo, hanqo, waaso, cashshenne iita ubbaa hinttefe haassite. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Aathidi issoy issuwas keehanne qadhetteyssata gidite. Xoossay Kiristtoosa baggara hinttew atto gidayssada hintteka wolis atto giite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:13">Qola 3:13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hiza, Xoossay dosiya naytada iya daanite. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kiristtoosi nuna dosidi bana nu gisho Xoossaas sawiya imonne yarshsho oothidi immidayssada hintteka siiqon de7ite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:18">Kessa 29:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:6">Maz 40:6</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Shin laymatethi, tunatethinne uuzetethi ammaniyaa asaas bessonna gisho hintte giddon ubbaraka si7ettofo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Xoossaa galatiteppe attin yeellayabaynne eeya odi woykko qidhey hinttew bessonna gisho hintte giddon ubbaka de7oppo. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hayssa erite; oonikka laymatey woykko tunabaa oothey woykko uuzettey Kiristtoosa kawotethaanne Xoossaa kawotethaa laattanaw dandda7enna. Uuzetethi eeqa goynno mela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hayssata gaason Xoossaa hanqoy kiitettonna asaa bolla yaana gisho oonikka hinttena pathonna odan cimmofo. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessa mela asaara issifetethi oothofite. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kase hintte dhuman de7ideta, shin ha77i Godaa baggara poo7on de7eeta. Hiza, poo7o asada poo7on simerettite. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Poo7oy lo77otethi, xillotethinne tumatethi ayfees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Godaa ufayssiyabaa oothanaw koyite. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Go77i baynna dhuma ooso qonccisiteppe attin iyara issifoppite. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Entti geeman oothiya oosuwa hari attoshin odanawukka yeellayees. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Shin ubbabay poo7on keyaa wode qonccen benttees. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Poo7oy ubbabaa qonccen bessees. Hessa gisho,</para>
  <para style="q">“Neno dhiskkeysso barkka;</para>
  <para style="q2">hayqoppe dendda;</para>
  <para style="q">Kiristtoosi ne bolla poo7ana” yaagettis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hiza, hintte waanidi de7iyakko akeeki be7ite. Cinccata giditeppe attin eeyata gidoppite. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Laythay iita gidiya gisho injjetiya wode ubbaa go7ettite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:5">Qola 4:5</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Godaa sheney aybeekko akeekiteppe attin eeyoppite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Geeshsha Ayyaanan gallas gallas kumiteppe attin dhayokko hinttena kaalethiya gisho woyne ushshan mathottofite. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mazmuren, sabaninne ayyaana yethan, issoy issuwara odetite. Qassi hintte wozanan zammarishenne sabbishe Godaa galatite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19-20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:16-17">Qola 3:16-17</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosa sunthan ubba wode Xoossaa Aawa ubbabaas galatite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kiristtoosa bonchchuwas gidi issoy issuwas haarettite.</para>
  <para style="s">Azinabaanne machchibaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Machcheto, Godaas haaretteyssada hintte azinatas haarettite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:18">Qola 3:18</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:1">1Phexi 3:1</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kiristtoosi woosa keethaas huu7e gideyssada azinikka ba machchees huu7e. Qassi Kiristtoos ba asatethi gidida woosa keethaa ashsheyssa. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Shin woosa keethay Kiristtoosas haaretteyssada machcheti bantta azinatas ubbaban haarettanaw bessees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Azinatoo, Kiristtoosi woosa keethaa dosidi bana iw immidayssada hintteka hintte machcheta dosite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:19">Qola 3:19</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:7">1Phexi 3:7</ref></char></note> <verse number="26" style="v"/>I woosa keethaa ba qaala baggara haathan meeccidi geeshshis. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kiristtoosi woosa keethaa qiti woykko som77o tuussi woykko hessa melabay baynna I kumetha bonchchuwara geeshshinne borettonnaaro oothidi baakko shiishanaw koyidi hessa oothis. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hessadakka, azinati banttana doseyssada bantta machcheta dosanaw bessees. Ba machchiw doseyssi bana dosees. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Bana ixxiya asi oonikka baawa, shin Kiristtoosi woosa keethaas ootheyssada ba asatethaa muzeesinne naagees. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nuuni Kiristtoosa asatethaa billiteta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Xoossaa qaalay, “Hessa gisho, asi ba aawanne ba aayiw aggidi, ba machcheera issife daana; entti nam77ayka issi asho gidana” yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Medhe 2:24</ref></char></note> <verse number="32" style="v"/>Hayssi gita xuura, shin taani hessa Kiristtoosabaanne woosa keethabaa leemiso oothada odays. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Gidoshin, hintte issoy issoy hintte machcheta hinttee, hinttena doseyssada dosite. Issi issi machcha ba azinaa bonchchanaw bessees.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Naytabaanne yelidayssatabaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nayto, hintte Godaaba gidiya gisho hinttena yelidayssatas kiitettite. Hessi hinttew bessiyabaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:20">Qola 3:20</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Ne aayiwunne ne aawa bonchcha.” Hessi ufayssa qaali de7iya koyro kiitaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2-3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Kessa 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Zaare 5:16</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v"/>“Ne hessa poliyabaa gidikko ubbay new injjetana; ne laythay sa7a bolla aduqqana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Aawato, hintte nayta Godaa qaala tamaarssoninne entta kaaleson dichchiteppe attin enttana caamisoppite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:21">Qola 3:21</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Godatabaanne aylletabaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Aylletoo, Kiristtoosas kiitetteyssada hintte sa7a godatas yashshan, bonchchoninne suure wozanan kiitettite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:22-25">Qola 3:22-25</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v"/>Entta sinthan saba demmanaw entti be7iya wode xalaala oothofite. Shin Kiristtoosa aylletada Xoossaa sheniya wozanappe polite. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Asas gidonnashin, Godaas gidi hintte kumetha wozanaappe oothite. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Aylle gidin woykko goda gidin issoy issoy ba oothida lo77o oosos Godaappe woyto ekkanayssa ereeta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Godato, asa som77o be7idi maaddonna Goday, saluwan de7eyssaa ereeta. Hessa gisho, hintte aylleta manddeyssa aggidi entti hinttew bonchchon kiitetteyssa mela hintte enttaw lo77obaa oothite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:1">Qola 4:1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:17">Zaare 10:17</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:25">Qola 3:25</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Xoossaa ola miisheta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Wurssethan, Godaaninne iya gita wolqqan minnite. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Xalahe cimuwa eqettanaw dandda7ana mela Xoossay hinttew immida ola miishiya ubbaa ma77ite. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nu olay asara gidonnashin, salon de7iya tuna ayyaana olanchchotara, maata aawatara, haareyssataranne ha dhuma alamiya wolqqatara.</para>
  <para style="rem">fig 21 fig*</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, iita gallasaa teqqanawunne ubbaa polidi, minnidi eqqanaw hintte dandda7ana mela Xoossaa ola miisheta ubbaa ma77ite. <verse number="14-15" style="v"/>Tumaa xeessan danccoda danccidi, xillotethaa xurureda tiran wothidi, sarotethaa Wonggelaa hintte tohuwan caammada aathidi minnidi eqqite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:5">Isa 11:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa 59:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:7">52:7</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v"/>He ubbaafe aathidi, Xalahey yeddiya laxiya tama dongge ubbaa toysanaw dandda7iya ammanuwa ubba wode gonddalleda oykkite. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Xoossaa atotetha biraata barnneexada hintte huu7en wothite; qassi Geeshsha Ayyaana bisuwa ikka, Xoossaa qaalaa oykkite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa 59:17</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v"/>Woossa aggofite; harataskka gaannatite; ubba wode Ayyaanan woossite. Hessan, geeshshatas salettonna minnidi ubba wode woossite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Taani Wonggelaa xuuraa yashshi baynna qonccisada odana mela Xoossay taw qaala immana mela woossite. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Taani hessa oothanaw kiitetas ha77ika qashon de7ey he Wonggelaa gishossa. Yaaniya gisho, taani yashshi baynna besseyssada odana mela taw woossite.</para>
  <para style="s">Wurssetha sarotho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Taani waana de7iyakkonne ay oothiyako hintte erana mela nu siiqo ishay, Godaa oosuwan ammanettida oosanchchoy, Tikiqoosi, tabaa ubbaa hinttew odana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Ha@O 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2Ximo 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:7-8">Qola 4:7-8</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nuuni ubbay waanidi de7iyakko hinttew odana melanne hinttena minthethana mela taani iya hintteko kiittas.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Xoossaa Aawappe, Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosappe sarotethaynne siiqoy ammanora issife ammaniyaa ubbaas gido. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Irxxonna siiqon nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosa siiqiya ubbaara Xoossaa aadho keehatethay gido.</para>
  <para style="restore">02-Oct-2008@09:05, Backup Description=23-Sep-2008@16:55, Ed Owen -</para>
</usx>
